  network i have a big potential partner  who's going to be listening to that show  and i have this one show to make an  impression this one show to close an  opportunity and it has to be great if  it's not great I've lost it and it's  never going to happen I put pressure on  myself so that I do the best job  possible and the next time I radio show  comes up I do the same thing I imagined  that this is my one shot and you've got  to do that every day with your business  this is your one shot imagine today this  is your shot today will define if your  business is going to be successful or  not what are you going to do to make  that happen the next customer you talk  to the next media person you talk to the  next supplier working with this is your  defining moment today you've got to  raise the stakes and make it important  it's got to be critical to you and when  you wake up tomorrow again this is your  day tomorrow is your day to I don't want  you to just float by too many  entrepreneurs float by we make enough to  survive to get by maybe to grow a little  bit get some employees for some people  but you're not living the life that you  want to live you're not having the  impact that you want to have and it's  because you're not making that goal  important enough to you it has to be  important do you want that life or are  you okay with what you're doing now  you're okay with being average going  after that life is scary I know it's  painful you're going to have to do  things that are beyond your comfort zone  you're going to have to stretch and  whenever we're confronted with that kind  of potential pain we back off and we  often need people to help us  push through and in a work situation you  have your manager to do that in your own  business you have to be that person and  do whatever it takes to help you realize  the importance of today today is  important for your company what are you  going to do to make it grow that has to  be your mindset every day coming in